  "notes": "Composed of {検|けん} (examine) + {眼|がん} (eye).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {検眼|けんがん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}ける→受ける：01215_ukeru⟧: to have an eye examination\n- {検眼|けんがん}⟦{士|し}→〜士：28352_shi⟧: optometrist (technician)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {視力検査|しりょくけんさ}: vision test — measures acuity specifically, one part of {検眼|けんがん}\n- ⟦{眼科|がんか}→眼科：11071_ganka⟧: ophthalmology — the medical department that treats the eyes",
